# Responsive Personal Portfolio Website

## Lab Title
WebDev Lab Assignment 3 - CSS Advanced

## Description
A responsive personal portfolio website created using HTML5 and CSS3.

## Features
- Header and Navigation
- Hero Section
- About Section
- Skills Section
- Projects Section
- Contact Form
- Footer

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Flexbox
- CSS Grid
- Media Queries
- CSS Transitions
- CSS Animations

## Responsive Behavior Testing

Tested breakpoints:
- Desktop: Above 800px
- Tablet: 600px to 800px
- Mobile: 600px and below

## Steps to View Responsive Behavior
1. Open index.html in a browser.
2. Right-click and select Inspect.
3. Click Toggle Device Toolbar.
4. Test different screen sizes.

## Project Files
- index.html
- style.css
- README.md

## Conclusion
This project demonstrates responsive web design using advanced CSS concepts.
